        "text": "Best Dental experience ever. The ladies at the front desk are so friendly and helpful. Veronica was so sweet and caring, and Dr. Zakkour is so calm, patient, kind and compassionate. What a great team!!! Thank you so much for our emergency consultation and next day wisdom tooth extraction. Highly recommend this Dental Clinic!",
