        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Big thanks to all the team of the clinic.great experience.very satified with all the treatments.no mistakes at all.dentist and his team are sooo friendly and welcoming.they make one feel very comfortable and relaxed.and do their job best way.thank you again\nNaima",
