      {
        "author_name": "Larissa M",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114546449069904101874/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLRSB46XUfsCpmTdzJ_qdN9e0hou8jVkfoLsudU2T2oYsblnQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Went to try this as a new dentist last fall because mine was overbooked. I was told I had cavities to fill only to find out when I went back to my original dentist that there weren't any to do!! A little questionable. Also I had booked with a specific dentist and was put with someone else when I arrived. Staff is very nice however.",
        "time": 1768234770,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Haytham Mehsen",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105675282644666017800/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQiWCLwVogmB5jeM0rP3sMv2mddMFZs3pYA11ThxRpiZTRktJy=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Amazing experience with Dr. Zaher Zakour! He is very skilled, caring, and always makes sure his patients feel comfortable. The clinic is spotless, well-organized, and the team is incredibly welcoming. I left with a big smile and complete confidence in the treatment I received. Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1756505406,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "mariam mekhaeil",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106044622688574298231/reviews",
